WEBVTT

00:02.430 --> 00:03.980
You'll be safe.

00:04.550 --> 00:06.360
We're with you.

00:10.020 --> 00:12.410
Now, watch your step.

00:13.740 --> 00:15.580
<i>What a curious boy...</i>

00:15.580 --> 00:20.930
<i>I'm the elder between us, 
yet I feel like I'm the child...</i>

00:21.760 --> 00:25.790
<i>Wouldn't he rather be 
taking my sister's hand?</i>

00:26.780 --> 00:31.090
<i>He doesn't compare me to my sister.</i>

00:31.090 --> 00:33.800
<i>What a coward I've been.</i>

00:33.800 --> 00:36.980
<i>I even spent all day today 
sulking that my sister</i>

00:36.980 --> 00:39.620
<i>was chosen for marriage 
because she's prettier,</i>

00:39.620 --> 00:42.610
<i>and that I'm just an afterthought...</i>

00:43.190 --> 00:47.520
<i>I was so rude to him earlier, as well.</i>

00:48.090 --> 00:50.730
<i>And yet... Lord Pastry never...</i>

01:00.290 --> 01:02.650
We'll hold the Sanctification Ceremony here?

01:03.010 --> 01:03.930
No.

01:04.850 --> 01:08.420
We'll be using my father's teleportation 
to fly to the royal capital.

01:08.790 --> 01:11.550
The ceremony will take place there.

01:11.550 --> 01:12.920
From here to the royal capital?

01:13.450 --> 01:15.380
I assure you, there's nothing to fear.

01:17.130 --> 01:17.890
Of course.

01:20.290 --> 01:21.120
Well, then...

01:23.000 --> 01:24.180
Shall we proceed?

01:29.010 --> 01:31.020
Please take hands among yourselves.

01:31.370 --> 01:33.570
We'll want to form a straight line like that.

01:36.150 --> 01:38.010
Even myself?

01:38.010 --> 01:39.780
It feels rather presumptuous...

01:40.040 --> 01:42.060
Of course, Caera.

01:48.310 --> 01:49.120
Let us begin.

02:00.900 --> 02:02.190
Lady Licorice.

02:02.190 --> 02:04.390
It's safe to open your eyes now.

02:12.240 --> 02:14.100
Welcome to the royal capital!

02:17.260 --> 02:22.280
<i>This is the tale of a genius patissier 
who died before his time,</i>

02:22.500 --> 02:26.560
<i>and was reincarnated as the son 
of a poor noble in another world</i>

02:26.560 --> 02:29.670
<i>to pursue a world full 
of desserts and smiles.</i>

02:30.580 --> 02:35.270
<i>It's a tale that is at once cold 
and unsparing, and syrupy sweet.</i>

02:36.680 --> 02:43.110
<i>His dream is to create this 
world's very own land of sweets!</i>

02:51.060 --> 02:53.650
<b>Sweet Reincarnation</b>

04:15.750 --> 04:20.750
<b>Schemes and Frothy Hearts</b>

04:17.980 --> 04:21.370
I called you all here for one reason.

04:21.770 --> 04:25.820
I desire your aid in restoring House Armire.

04:26.230 --> 04:30.200
A perfect opportunity to confound and 
even supplant those vexing Kadleceks

04:30.200 --> 04:32.910
has fallen into my lap.

04:33.350 --> 04:36.010
We'll do anything, so long 
as your money's good.

04:36.010 --> 04:37.750
Who are we killing?

04:37.990 --> 04:39.560
You're not killing anyone.

04:39.560 --> 04:42.220
I just want you to bring a woman here.

04:43.240 --> 04:44.170
A woman?

04:44.610 --> 04:47.170
You'll get ten gold pieces if you succeed.

04:47.170 --> 04:49.950
Ten gold pieces for bringing one woman here?!

04:49.950 --> 04:52.100
Talk about easy money!

04:53.270 --> 04:58.430
You wouldn't be having us kidnap 
just any woman you've fallen for.

04:59.440 --> 05:01.600
She's a noblewoman, isn't she?

05:02.570 --> 05:05.780
Yes. A daughter of House Hubarek.

05:06.010 --> 05:08.490
Margrave Hubarek, eh?

05:08.490 --> 05:10.970
Petra Mille Hubarek.

05:11.440 --> 05:15.770
She's soon to be married 
into Duke Kadlecek's family.

05:17.980 --> 05:19.350
All right.

05:19.350 --> 05:20.330
Let's go.

05:22.100 --> 05:24.470
See that you do this correctly.

05:26.140 --> 05:28.640
Who the hell do you think you're talking to?

05:34.010 --> 05:35.930
Filthy wild dogs.

05:37.210 --> 05:40.270
Boss, you sure you wanna take this job?

05:40.270 --> 05:42.020
It's too weird, right?

05:42.020 --> 05:45.410
He's trying to earn his 
noble station back, right?

05:45.410 --> 05:48.760
Hiring people like us to kidnap a girl

05:48.760 --> 05:51.410
is just dragging his name through the mud.

05:52.840 --> 05:55.730
He's likely after two things:

05:56.100 --> 06:00.750
First, to disgrace House Kadlecek.

06:00.750 --> 06:03.230
It would be humiliating for 
the leader of the central army

06:03.230 --> 06:07.070
to let his own grandson's bride be kidnapped.

06:08.340 --> 06:09.640
Second...

06:11.120 --> 06:14.280
Armire wants to save the 
kidnapped girl himself,

06:14.280 --> 06:18.150
and use the clout he'll receive 
to retake his noble title.

06:19.070 --> 06:23.920
Most likely, by marrying 
the very girl he kidnapped!

06:24.440 --> 06:27.180
Boy, what a creep!

06:27.180 --> 06:32.370
A kidnapped noblewoman, married off
 to the hero who saved her...

06:32.370 --> 06:35.560
It's a real "happily ever after" story.

06:43.650 --> 06:45.960
That's a lot of security...

06:46.580 --> 06:49.610
Men that Margrave Hubarek 
dispatched in advance

06:49.610 --> 06:51.550
and friendly forces from nearby, I'm told.

06:51.550 --> 06:53.540
Very impressive indeed.

06:54.050 --> 06:59.020
A poor knight's household like ours 
could never amass a force like this.

06:59.240 --> 07:00.960
You didn't have to bring that up!

07:04.130 --> 07:06.460
Sister, are you ill?

07:06.460 --> 07:07.400
No...

07:07.810 --> 07:10.260
But it almost doesn't feel real.

07:10.590 --> 07:12.060
To be engaged...

07:12.480 --> 07:15.740
I'm sure it'll feel real 
when your betrothed arrives.

07:16.110 --> 07:18.280
Lord Squale is a fine young man.

07:18.870 --> 07:20.210
Yes, I know that he is.

07:21.010 --> 07:23.670
They showed me his portrait.

07:24.070 --> 07:25.330
He is very handsome.

07:25.330 --> 07:28.120
I simply can't wait to meet him in person!

07:31.390 --> 07:35.190
<i>Boy, those matchmaking 
photos really do the trick!</i>

07:35.770 --> 07:40.430
<i>There's nothing more important 
than planning and prep work!</i>

07:40.920 --> 07:42.250
<i>It's true with sweets, too...</i>

07:42.250 --> 07:44.970
<i>You'll always fail if you 
don't do your mise en place!</i>

07:46.110 --> 07:47.850
We'll start with Petra.

07:48.500 --> 07:50.440
The priest is waiting.

07:50.440 --> 07:51.350
Yes, Father.

07:56.130 --> 07:58.150
<i>Right, I'm at work.</i>

07:59.500 --> 08:01.000
We're here, boss!

08:03.770 --> 08:06.170
How are things at Duke Kadlecek's estate?

08:06.170 --> 08:08.170
Tons of people there, too.

08:08.740 --> 08:10.560
Not sure how they caught wind of it,

08:10.560 --> 08:14.130
but it seems even the lords of remote 
fiefs have made their way here.

08:14.450 --> 08:19.280
The joining of the houses of a margrave and 
a duke will create a powerful alliance.

08:19.680 --> 08:23.000
They likely want to curry 
favor while they can.

08:23.680 --> 08:26.820
I've got Cointreau on standby 
at the duke's estate.

08:26.820 --> 08:28.980
He'll let us know if anything goes down.

08:29.760 --> 08:31.100
Now, Pas.

08:31.100 --> 08:33.820
I have an important mission for you.

08:33.820 --> 08:34.820
What is it?

08:34.820 --> 08:39.250
Petra's Sanctification Ceremony 
won't be finished for a while now.

08:39.730 --> 08:43.540
Would you help Lady Licorice 
relax in a guest room?

08:45.800 --> 08:47.720
She appears quite tired.

08:48.570 --> 08:50.090
I didn't even notice.

08:50.690 --> 08:55.210
Time to rise to the occasion 
as an attentive escort!

09:00.250 --> 09:01.770
Lady Licorice...

09:02.250 --> 09:04.740
It must be hard to relax here, 
with so much going on.

09:05.190 --> 09:08.230
Would you like to rest 
a while in a guest room?

09:08.230 --> 09:09.320
But...

09:09.320 --> 09:11.230
It's important to take breaks.

09:12.060 --> 09:13.070
I'll escort you there.

09:14.490 --> 09:15.720
O-Of course...

09:17.910 --> 09:19.070
Hey, you player!

09:19.070 --> 09:22.340
Don't go doing anything 
to make your lady cry!

09:23.360 --> 09:25.840
I'm not like you, Feuille!

09:26.290 --> 09:28.980
Ah, the innocence of youth!

09:28.980 --> 09:30.000
Feuille.

09:30.390 --> 09:33.850
Would you kindly not fill my 
son's head with strange ideas?

09:33.850 --> 09:36.590
Hey, just trying to be nice!

09:45.830 --> 09:48.740
The Sanctification Ceremony 
should be finishing soon.

09:53.810 --> 09:55.410
Kadlecek...

09:55.410 --> 09:58.950
I'll soon revenge myself upon you!

10:03.750 --> 10:05.910
Staff Officer Vezhen of the Central Army!

10:06.350 --> 10:11.050
I'm here to guide Lady Petra in accordance 
with General Kadlecek's orders!

10:11.950 --> 10:13.590
An admirable dedication to duty.

10:14.010 --> 10:17.930
Please convey my warmest gratitude 
towards His Grace for his kindness!

10:27.480 --> 10:28.560
Moving out!

10:32.010 --> 10:34.270
There's one step down, eh?

10:34.570 --> 10:35.500
Yes.

10:35.500 --> 10:39.540
Once the reception for the engagement 
is over and the happy couple returns,

10:39.540 --> 10:41.980
all that remains is escorting 
them back to their home territory

10:41.980 --> 10:43.420
along with Licorice and the others.

10:43.420 --> 10:45.620
So far, so good.

10:46.330 --> 10:47.260
However...

10:48.180 --> 10:49.850
With a crowd like that...

10:49.850 --> 10:53.240
Even if they purged anyone 
suspicious beforehand,

10:53.240 --> 10:55.460
we still can't let our guard down.

10:55.460 --> 10:58.430
I'm more worried about the kid, myself!

10:58.430 --> 10:59.260
Pas?

10:59.500 --> 11:04.850
A man who has come of age and an 
unpledged lady in a room, alone...

11:04.850 --> 11:07.250
What misunderstandings might occur?

11:07.250 --> 11:09.510
I can't help but worry!

11:09.510 --> 11:12.880
You seem rather amused, 
despite your claims of worry.

11:13.240 --> 11:16.510
Lady Licorice's Sanctification 
Ceremony will begin shortly.

11:16.510 --> 11:17.940
There's no need to worry.

11:19.200 --> 11:19.900
Besides...

11:20.230 --> 11:22.720
They've got a formidable chaperon with them.

11:23.830 --> 11:24.870
Um...

11:25.080 --> 11:26.760
Might I ask why you've joined us?

11:26.760 --> 11:30.080
My duty is to protect Lady Licorice.

11:30.490 --> 11:34.290
I felt sure you'd accompany Lady 
Petra to her engagement reception...

11:34.650 --> 11:38.630
My duty is to protect Her Ladyship!

11:41.250 --> 11:44.090
<i>As I'd expect from a noblewoman's 
personal attendant...</i>

11:44.520 --> 11:49.480
<i>She's determined to prevent an undesirable 
affair, even though I'm just a child!</i>

11:50.580 --> 11:52.890
C-Could I invite you to sit?

11:53.110 --> 11:54.480
I will stand.

11:54.820 --> 11:56.940
<i>This is so awkward.</i>

11:57.690 --> 12:00.940
S-Surely you might prefer to relax?

12:01.450 --> 12:05.700
Sweets never taste good if you 
let the dough get too hard.

12:07.370 --> 12:10.340
S-Sorry, I suppose I shouldn't worry...

12:10.340 --> 12:12.720
Caera, your expression is scary.

12:12.720 --> 12:15.210
It's to protect you, Your Ladyship!

12:15.890 --> 12:18.030
<i>This is the opposite of relaxing!</i>

12:20.250 --> 12:21.630
Lord Pastry?

12:22.070 --> 12:24.590
Did you hear something just now?

12:30.140 --> 12:31.030
What was that?

12:44.610 --> 12:45.690
Milady!

12:47.160 --> 12:49.240
Milady!

12:56.640 --> 12:58.020
What happened?!

12:59.980 --> 13:01.400
What is all this?

13:03.430 --> 13:05.430
H-Her Ladyship...

13:05.820 --> 13:07.090
Where's my son?

13:07.090 --> 13:08.490
H-He was with her...

13:09.290 --> 13:11.210
Boss, this isn't good.

13:11.850 --> 13:14.070
It's a giant hole, almost perfectly circular,

13:14.070 --> 13:16.480
and too deep for us to make out the bottom.

13:16.970 --> 13:19.440
To create such a thing in an instant...

13:19.980 --> 13:20.940
It must be magic.

13:21.180 --> 13:22.440
The kid...

13:22.440 --> 13:24.650
Feuille, to House Kadlecek!

13:24.650 --> 13:27.650
Explain the situation to the 
margrave and the others!

13:27.650 --> 13:28.570
Boss?

13:29.520 --> 13:30.670
Boss?!

13:39.770 --> 13:42.960
When he gets an idea in his head, 
he never listens to anyone, does he?

13:42.960 --> 13:46.070
Is this what they mean by 
"like father, like son"?

14:06.290 --> 14:07.430
<i>Where am I?</i>

14:07.750 --> 14:09.490
<i>We fell into that hole, sofas and all...</i>

14:10.440 --> 14:11.640
<i>Lico—</i>

14:11.640 --> 14:13.290
Awake, are you?

14:15.380 --> 14:16.250
No.

14:16.810 --> 14:18.330
Hey, that's the way.

14:18.330 --> 14:21.010
You just keep being a good little boy.

14:21.010 --> 14:22.740
We'll release you soon enough.

14:23.570 --> 14:27.660
Would you care to explain 
why we've been kidnapped?

14:27.660 --> 14:30.610
I'm under no obligation 
to explain things to you.

14:30.970 --> 14:32.100
<i>That hole...</i>

14:33.070 --> 14:34.680
<i>Was he the one who made it?</i>

14:36.200 --> 14:39.230
<i>Caera was left behind when we fell...</i>

14:39.830 --> 14:44.230
<i>I'm sure Father will get the 
story from her, and take action.</i>

14:45.290 --> 14:49.530
<i>Now... what's the best thing for 
me to do until help arrives?</i>

14:49.940 --> 14:53.290
<i>And... why did he kidnap me?</i>

14:53.710 --> 14:57.050
<i>I'm the heir to a poor knighthood, 
not worth much at ransom...</i>

14:58.280 --> 15:01.090
<i>Could it be... Lady Licorice?</i>

15:02.390 --> 15:05.450
Keep an eye on them. They're how we get paid.

15:05.450 --> 15:06.500
Yes, boss.

15:08.000 --> 15:10.510
Don't get any ideas about escaping.

15:10.510 --> 15:14.470
One wrong move, and I'll 
happily dispose of you.

15:16.580 --> 15:19.890
<i>I... I have to protect her.</i>

15:35.370 --> 15:38.100
<i>No sign of anyone here.</i>

15:39.080 --> 15:39.930
<i>Pas...</i>

15:44.050 --> 15:45.400
Are you awake?

15:47.690 --> 15:50.510
Do you understand the situation we're in?

15:51.850 --> 15:54.470
I'm sorry... I'm afraid I don't.

15:54.890 --> 15:56.940
We've been kidnapped.

15:57.260 --> 15:59.930
I think we're in the kidnappers' hideout.

16:00.570 --> 16:02.710
Kidnapped?

16:02.710 --> 16:03.850
No...

16:04.320 --> 16:06.600
It's all right. I'm with you.

16:06.920 --> 16:08.460
Don't worry.

16:08.460 --> 16:09.940
Lord Pastry...

16:10.920 --> 16:12.640
<i>I wonder why...</i>

16:12.640 --> 16:17.240
<i>When he tells me not to worry, 
I feel like I really don't have to...</i>

16:17.640 --> 16:19.370
Playing tough, eh?

16:19.370 --> 16:21.370
What a man.

16:21.370 --> 16:24.920
<i>The man with the mustache is likely 
the one who cast the spell.</i>

16:25.880 --> 16:28.990
<i>But there's no guarantee there aren't 
other magic-users among them.</i>

16:29.410 --> 16:31.260
<i>I have to act carefully.</i>

16:31.630 --> 16:34.050
<i>I need to learn more.</i>

16:34.860 --> 16:37.600
Hey... what are you gonna do with us?

16:37.920 --> 16:38.980
Huh?

16:38.980 --> 16:41.610
Well, we know what to do with the lady.

16:41.610 --> 16:43.750
You we might have to kill.

16:43.750 --> 16:47.520
You could get 200 gold coins if you don't!

16:48.150 --> 16:49.610
Two hundred?!

16:49.850 --> 16:52.570
<i>It's likely that someone else 
arranged the kidnapping.</i>

16:53.090 --> 16:55.030
<i>I need to find out who it is.</i>

16:53.590 --> 16:55.030
Explain yourself!

16:56.310 --> 16:59.110
I'm the heir to a noble family!

16:59.110 --> 17:01.980
<i>I'm worth a great deal in ransom!</i>

16:59.590 --> 17:01.330
Lord Pastry?

17:02.490 --> 17:03.500
I know!

17:03.500 --> 17:06.210
If the man who invited 
us here is a noble, too,

17:06.210 --> 17:08.410
you might get even more money!

17:08.410 --> 17:09.420
What?

17:09.710 --> 17:14.420
Negotiations between nobles are 
frequently solved with money!

17:16.330 --> 17:17.340
H-How much?

17:19.420 --> 17:21.800
I-If you're making this up...

17:21.800 --> 17:23.040
I'll smack you!

17:23.040 --> 17:23.770
Got it?

17:25.310 --> 17:26.760
<i>There's no doubt in my mind.</i>

17:26.760 --> 17:28.230
<i>A noble is behind this!</i>

17:28.880 --> 17:30.940
<i>If this is a noble's mansion...</i>

17:31.560 --> 17:35.030
<i>From the ornamental construction, 
they must be of a high rank.</i>

17:35.610 --> 17:37.130
<i>A duke, perhaps?</i>

17:37.670 --> 17:40.550
<i>But given the state of disrepair,</i>

17:40.550 --> 17:43.080
<i>it hasn't been properly maintained 
in at least ten years.</i>

17:43.670 --> 17:47.790
<i>Could it be a former noble, 
stripped of their title?</i>

17:48.740 --> 17:55.760
<i>And either the Kadleceks or the Hubareks 
were involved in their fall ten years prior.</i>

17:56.370 --> 17:58.470
<i>When we were assigned to 
Lady Petra's protection,</i>

17:58.470 --> 18:00.810
<i>we received a list of 
potential troublemakers.</i>

18:00.810 --> 18:02.800
<i>The name on that list who 
fits these conditions...</i>

18:05.140 --> 18:08.140
<i>The former duke of House Armire!</i>

18:08.990 --> 18:11.600
<i>That's the most I can figure out for now.</i>

18:17.830 --> 18:18.670
<i>Replicate!</i>

18:21.830 --> 18:23.160
<i>Go to my father!</i>

18:27.290 --> 18:32.710
The margrave said he can't 
spare any men right now.

18:32.710 --> 18:34.920
He has to prioritize Lady 
Petra's engagement reception.

18:34.920 --> 18:36.120
I see.

18:36.490 --> 18:37.650
How awful.

18:39.000 --> 18:42.950
<i>I can tell she's devoted to the margrave.</i>

18:42.950 --> 18:45.050
<i>This must be very hard on her.</i>

18:45.470 --> 18:48.050
Who could be behind this?

18:48.050 --> 18:51.100
If we knew that, we could take action, but...

18:51.610 --> 18:54.140
How can you remain so calm?!

18:54.140 --> 18:58.090
Your own son was kidnapped 
along with Her Ladyship!

18:58.090 --> 18:59.530
Yet you're completely unconcerned—

18:59.530 --> 19:01.500
He's not unconcerned!

19:03.920 --> 19:06.660
It would be one thing if 
Lady Licorice were alone,

19:06.660 --> 19:08.120
but Pas is with her.

19:08.120 --> 19:11.050
He'll be working on a plan!

19:25.900 --> 19:26.760
Pas...

19:27.450 --> 19:30.140
That's the kid's ribbon! 
Does it have a clue on it?

19:30.550 --> 19:32.600
They're being held at the Armire Estate!

19:33.000 --> 19:36.320
The culprit is likely from the 
former ducal house of Armire!

19:38.670 --> 19:40.610
Feuille, go to Duke Kadlecek's estate.

19:40.850 --> 19:44.200
Round up as many men as you can to help!

19:45.320 --> 19:48.470
I'll recruit able men from 
those around the church.

19:48.470 --> 19:50.790
Then we'll head right to the Armire Estate!

19:50.790 --> 19:52.640
Before you go bounding off,

19:52.640 --> 19:57.050
wouldn't it be faster to use your 
magic to <i>send</i> me to Duke Kadlecek's?

19:58.300 --> 20:00.750
I know you're worried about the kid,

20:00.750 --> 20:02.880
but don't go losing your head about it!

20:03.190 --> 20:04.680
I'll send you right now!

20:06.840 --> 20:08.600
Do your best, Feuille.

20:09.110 --> 20:10.480
Sure thing!

20:15.500 --> 20:16.480
Glacage.

20:16.480 --> 20:17.220
Sir!

20:26.410 --> 20:27.530
Chief?

20:27.820 --> 20:30.410
This stupid little girl!

20:34.040 --> 20:35.020
Look out!

20:37.410 --> 20:39.040
Outta my way!

20:39.040 --> 20:40.550
Lord Pastry!

20:43.010 --> 20:47.250
<i>Did that kid just appear 
in front of the chief?</i>

20:47.650 --> 20:49.440
He'll pay for this, damn it.

20:49.440 --> 20:51.560
What happened, boss?

20:51.560 --> 20:56.560
The old bastard said we kidnapped 
the wrong sister, and he won't pay!

20:57.310 --> 20:59.020
The girl's a twin!

20:59.650 --> 21:05.160
The engagement's going off at the 
duke's house without a hitch!

21:06.410 --> 21:09.960
<i>Of course... They were 
actually after Lady Petra!</i>

21:08.880 --> 21:10.010
We're getting outta here!

21:10.460 --> 21:12.920
<i>Lady Licorice was taken by accident!</i>

21:11.020 --> 21:12.760
Right! Wh-Whadda we do about them?

21:13.370 --> 21:17.210
We can't leave any witnesses behind.

21:17.210 --> 21:19.190
Not that irritating Armire,

21:19.190 --> 21:20.830
and not these little brats!

21:20.830 --> 21:22.800
N-No...

21:22.800 --> 21:25.380
No hard feelings, dear.

21:25.670 --> 21:29.930
H-Help me...

21:35.390 --> 21:36.520
That was a bad move...

21:38.650 --> 21:41.690
Taking your eyes off of 
the other person here.

21:41.690 --> 21:45.340
D-Damn you... When did you...

21:45.340 --> 21:47.690
I'm under no obligation 
to explain things to you.

21:48.280 --> 21:50.120
L-Lord Pastry...

21:50.620 --> 21:53.480
Didn't I tell you? I'm with you!

21:55.120 --> 21:56.790
Would you care to surrender?

21:56.790 --> 21:58.200
Don't be stupid.

21:58.200 --> 21:59.830
We're just getting started!

22:01.480 --> 22:03.710
This is checkmate, then.

23:37.080 --> 23:39.240
Next time on <i>Sweet Reincarnation</i>...

23:39.040 --> 23:44.940
<b>Beloved Smiles and Bak{)\c&H125BDF&\alphaFF\t(1253,1587,\alpha00)}ed Treats</b>

23:39.240 --> 23:41.430
"Beloved Smiles and Baked Treats."

23:41.800 --> 23:43.130
Bon appétit!

23:44.940 --> 23:50.250
<b>Illustration:</b>

23:44.940 --> 23:50.250
<b>Huuka Kazabana</b>
